{{!
    @template local_ai_reportcreator/report_list

    Report list page body: create-report button plus either an empty-state
    notification or a table of existing reports.

    Classes required for JS: none.
    Data attributes required for JS: none.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * createurl - URL to the create-report page
    * createlabel - Label for the create-report button
    * hasreports - boolean, true when reports exist
    * emptynotification - pre-rendered $OUTPUT->notification() HTML, only used when hasreports is false
    * tablehtml - pre-rendered html_writer::table() HTML, only used when hasreports is true

    Example context (json):
    {
        "createurl": "https://example.com/local/ai_reportcreator/create.php",
        "createlabel": "Create new report",
        "hasreports": false,
        "emptynotification": "<div class=\"alert alert-info\">No reports yet.</div>",
        "tablehtml": ""
    }
}}
<div class="mb-3">
    <a href="{{createurl}}" class="btn btn-primary">{{createlabel}}</a>
</div>
{{#hasreports}}
{{{tablehtml}}}
{{/hasreports}}
{{^hasreports}}
{{{emptynotification}}}
{{/hasreports}}
